A valid demonstration showed color 1 outlining rectangular rooms against color 5. Only the interior background cells were recolored to 4; the outline and all exterior cells remained unchanged. One demo had a 2x4 outline with a 2x2 interior; another had multiple outline-bounded rectangles, where only each actual cavity's interior changed. A later test used color 8 outlines against background 2, with a 4-row by 5-column rectangle bounded on its left by a vertical segment, top and bottom by horizontal segments, and right edge by the grid border: fill the enclosed 3x3 interior, not all cells of the right-side background component.

